# Everything in this repo that executes, executes on Linux.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without these lines a fresh clone or
# any `git checkout` of these paths rewrites them with CRLF -- and SkyPilot
# uploads the working tree verbatim. The box then runs `bash phase0.sh` and dies
# on `$'\r': command not found`, which reads like a missing interpreter and is
# not one. The YAML fails more quietly still.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to "fix" line endings inside them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pt   binary
*.xlsx binary
